			(property "Description" "AP7347DQ - 500mA CMOS LDO Regulator w/ Enable\n\nThe AP2112 is CMOS process low dropout linear regulator with enable function, the regulator delivers a guaranteed 600mA (min.) continuous load current.\n\nFeatures\n\n• Output Voltage Accuracy: ±1%\n• Output Current: 500mA\n• Foldback Short Current Protection: 180mA\n• Enable Function to Turn ON/OFF VOUT\n• Low Dropout Voltage (3.3V): 270mV (Typ.) @IOUT=500mA\n• Excellent Load Regulation: 22.5mV\n• Excellent Line Regulation: 0.02%/V (Typ.)\n• Low Quiescent Current: 60μA (Typ.)\n• Low Standby Current: 0.01μA (Typ.)\n• Low Output Noise: 60μVRMS\n• PSRR: 100Hz -65dB, 1kHz -65dB\n•  OTSD Protection\n• Stable  with  1.0μF Flexible Cap: Ceramic, Tantalum and Aluminum Electrolytic\n• Operation Temperature Range: -40°C to 85°C\n• ESD: MM 400V, HBM 4000V"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
